WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.080
Lost on a website we sent you to?

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:03.770
No problem.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:05.760
Take a screenshot.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:11.620
Open a free chatbot like chatgpt, Gemini or Grok, and attach the picture.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:17.280
Then paste a ready prompt, and it will tell you where to tap next, one step at a time.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:20.110
Crop out names and passwords first.
